o request my vtuber, Az.\nAz is a star bat from space. She’s easy-going, playful, and mischievous.  She has star bat ears, pale hair that is tinted brighter blue at the ends and starry space bat wings. She can fly and likes to eat sweets/candy and also make portals.\n\nThe pose and everything is up to you.  I would love something Valentine’s Day themed but it doesn’t have to be. I’ll be happy with any pose.\n\nThank you for your time and consideration!\nRef:https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1uOS5xmu_cY11yMigfro8jzPnliqxFdkh\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1uOS5xmu_cY11yMigfro8jzPnliqxFdkh", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@DEHOdesu/works/27", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/08c7159b/uploads/origins/a9392843-9c70-4776-a570-ab34e0429052?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=3d1f71a764a5ba65a485adbad69a5577", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/08c7159b/uploads/origins/a9392843-9c70-4776-a570-ab34e0429052?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=3d1f71a764a5ba65a485adbad69a5577, https://si.imgix.net/08c7159b/uploads/origins/a9392843-9c70-4776-a570-ab34e0429052?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=87b3aff4439b4714063bd224df32bd09 2x, https://si.imgix.net/08c7159b/uploads/origins/a9392843-9c70-4776-a570-ab34e0429052?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=3ff70e889bb680aa690a57dba516c764 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "こんにちは、先生、\n\nあなたの絵を見て、とても気に入りました！EN vtuberのItsiを描いてほしいです。とても元気で笑い声が素敵なエビちゃんです。ポーズや表情はお任せします。\n\nItsi: https://x.com/PrawnStarItsi/status/1857501392614850682\n\nありがとうございました！", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@DEHOdesu/works/26", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/b985f720/uploads/origins/53fc679f-b95a-4688-bdd1-17eebdeb634d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=acc961fd66ea605430875e7143691301", "t